    "format": "<style>.kfh{padding:10px 14px;background:#1a1a35;border-bottom:1px solid #2a2a50;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;}.kft{color:#f5c518;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;}.kfd{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#4caf7d;animation:kfp 1.5s ease-in-out infinite;}@keyframes kfp{0%,100%{opacity:1;transform:scale(1);}50%{opacity:0.45;transform:scale(1.5);}}.kfs{display:flex;gap:20px;}.kfst{text-align:center;}.kfsv{color:#f5c518;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;line-height:1;}.kfsl{color:#a0a0c0;font-size:9px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin-top:2px;}.kfr{display:flex;align-items:center;padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #1a1a35;gap:12px;}.kfu{background:#1a1a35;border:1px solid #2a2a50;border-radius:4px;padding:3px 8px;color:#f5c518;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;min-width:52px;text-align:center;}.kfa{color:#2a2a50;font-size:14px;flex-shrink:0;}.kfm{color:#a0a0c0;font-size:12px;flex-shrink:0;}.kfmb{color:#f0f0f0;}.kfbar{background:#2a2a50;border-radius:3px;height:5px;width:60px;flex-shrink:0;}.kfbf{height:5px;border-radius:3px;background:#f5c518;}.kfv{color:#f5c518;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;flex-shrink:0;min-width:42px;text-align:right;}.kfts{flex:1;text-align:right;color:#a0a0c0;font-size:11px;}</style><div style=\"background:#12122a;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #2a2a50;\"><div class=\"kfh\"><div class=\"kft\"><div class=\"kfd\"></div>Kafka → MongoDB · Valoraciones en tiempo real</div><div class=\"kfs\"><div class=\"kfst\"><div class=\"kfsv\">{{msg.payload.stats.total}}</div><div class=\"kfsl\">eventos</div></div><div class=\"kfst\"><div class=\"kfsv\">{{msg.payload.stats.avg}} ★</div><div class=\"kfsl\">media últimos 20</div></div><div class=\"kfst\"><div style=\"color:#a0a0c0;font-size:10px;margin-top:4px;\">actualiz. cada 10 s</div></div></div></div><div ng-repeat=\"item in msg.payload.events track by $index\" ng-style=\"{'background':$index%2===0?'#0a0a1a':'#12122a'}\" class=\"kfr\"><div class=\"kfu\">U‑{{item.userId}}</div><span class=\"kfa\">→</span><div class=\"kfm\">película <span class=\"kfmb\">{{item.movieId}}</span></div><div class=\"kfbar\"><div class=\"kfbf\" ng-style=\"{'width':item.pct+'%'}\"></div></div><div class=\"kfv\">{{item.rating}} ★</div><div class=\"kfts\">{{item.ts}}</div></div><div ng-if=\"!msg.payload.events||!msg.payload.events.length\" style=\"padding:32px;color:#a0a0c0;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-size:2em;margin-bottom:8px;\">📡</div><div>Sin eventos aún — inicia el productor Kafka:</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px;color:#f5c518;font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;\">python streaming/producer/ratings_producer.py</div></div></div>",
